---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Notice | Meridian Construction Companies"
  description="How Meridian Construction Companies collects and uses the information you send through this website."
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy notice', href: '/privacy/' }]}
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Privacy" title="Privacy notice" lede="Last updated October 2, 2026." />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2 class="h3">What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit the estimate request form, we collect the information you enter — such as your name, company,
        email address, phone number, project details — and any file you choose to attach. If you call or email us, we
        receive the information you share in that conversation.
      </p>
      <h2 class="h3">How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use this information only to respond to your inquiry, prepare estimates and communicate with you about your
        project. We do not sell your information or share it with third parties for their marketing.
      </p>
      <h2 class="h3">Service providers</h2>
      <p>
        Form submissions are received and stored by our website hosting provider’s form service so that we can read
        them. Like most websites, our host may also keep standard server logs (such as IP address and browser type)
        for security and reliability.
      </p>
      <h2 class="h3">Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not currently use advertising or analytics cookies. If that changes, we will update this
        notice and, where required, ask for your consent first.
      </p>
      <h2 class="h3">Retention and your choices</h2>
      <p>
        We keep inquiry information for as long as needed to respond to you and for our ordinary business records. To
        ask what information we hold about you, or to request that we correct or delete it, call us at
        <a href={site.phone.href}>{site.phone.display}</a> or write to {site.name}, {site.address.street},
        {site.address.city}, {site.address.region} {site.address.postalCode}.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
